From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Stefan Hertenberger <erde74@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 31 Oct 2026 01:35:31 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 18/26] plan9: shutdown(Write) as a half close (ctl "shutdown",
 after what a pump has buffered, on the ctl opened at the call: a later open
 by name could find another conversation); a dropped non-blocking listener
 frees its port at once

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 library/std/src/sys/net/connection/plan9.rs   | 21 ++++++-
 .../std/src/sys/net/connection/plan9/pump.rs  | 57 ++++++++++++++++---
 2 files changed, 70 insertions(+), 8 deletions(-)

diff --git a/library/std/src/sys/net/connection/plan9.rs b/library/std/src/sys/net/connection/plan9.rs
